  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"flex-container flex-1-2-1-6\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\"><div class=\"flex-container flex-1-2-1-6-0\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\"><div class=\"flex-container flex-1-2-1-6-0-0\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\"><div style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,0,0\">ĐỀ SỐ 7\r\nVECTOR 2D</p></div></div><div class=\"flex-container flex-1-2-1-6-0-1\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\"><div style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,1,0\">⏱ 30 phút | 💻 C++</p></div></div><div class=\"flex-container flex-1-2-1-6-0-2\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\"><div style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Lớp Vector2Chieu:</b></p></div><div style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%;\"><ul data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,1\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,1,0,0\">Thuộc tính: <code data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">x</code>, <code data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"15\">y</code> (double), cấu tử mặc định</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,1,1,0\">Phương thức <code data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">doDai()</code> trả về độ dài vector</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,1,2,0\">Nạp chồng toán tử <code data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"18\">-</code> và <code data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,1,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">==</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,1,3,0\">Hàm bạn <code data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"8\">&gt;&gt;</code> và <code data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"14\">&lt;&lt;</code></p></li></ul></div><div class=\"flex-container flex-1-2-1-6-0-2-2\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\"><div style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%;\"><p data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,6,0,2,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">main():</b> Nhập v1, v2; in (v1 - v2) và doDai(v1). So sánh v1 == v2.</p></div></div></div></div></div>",
